@startuml 顺序图-RAG问答详细
' ============================================
' 用例2：离线RAG文献问答 - 详细顺序图
' 基于实际代码：LocalAiService + LlamaServerChatClient
' 参与者 → 边界类 → 控制类 → 实体类 → 外部系统
' ============================================

skinparam sequenceParticipantBackgroundColor #ECF0F1
skinparam sequenceParticipantBorderColor #2C3E50
skinparam sequenceActorBackgroundColor #FDEBD0
skinparam sequenceActorBorderColor #E67E22
skinparam sequenceBoxBackgroundColor #F8F9F9
skinparam sequenceBoxBorderColor #BDC3C7
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FCF3CF
skinparam noteBorderColor #F39C12
skinparam maxMessageSize 300

title 用例2：离线RAG文献问答 — 详细顺序图

' ========================================
' 参与者定义
' ========================================
actor "用户\n(研究者/学生)" as User

' 边界类
box "边界类 (Boundary)" #E8F8F5
    participant "MainWindow\n(主窗口)" as MainWindow
    participant "RagTab\n(RAG问答面板)" as RagTab
end box

' 控制类
box "控制类 (Control)" #FDEDEC
    participant "RagTabViewModel\n(聊天视图模型)" as ChatVM
    participant "LocalAiService\n(本地AI服务)" as AISvc
    participant "QueryUnderstandingService\n(查询理解服务)" as QuerySvc
    participant "AnswerComposer\n(回答组装器)" as Composer
    participant "CandidateRetriever\n(候选检索器)" as Retriever
    participant "ChunkRanker\n(分块排序器)" as Ranker
end box

' 实体类
box "实体类 (Entity)" #F2F3F4
    participant "LLamaEmbedder\n(向量嵌入器)" as Embedder
    participant "LlamaServerChatClient\n(LLM聊天客户端)" as ChatClient
    participant "LlamaServerProcess\n(Reranker进程)" as RerankerProc
    participant "RagOptions\n(RAG配置)" as Options
    participant "QueryProfile\n(查询画像)" as Profile
    participant "ScoredChunk\n(评分分块)" as Scored
end box

' 外部系统
box "外部系统 / 基础设施" #FADBD8
    participant "llama-server\n(LLM推理服务)" as LlamaServer
    participant "FileSystem\n(文件系统)" as FS
end box

' ========================================
' 交互流程
' ========================================

== 阶段0：系统初始化（冷启动） ==

User -> RagTab : 1. 切换到RAG问答标签页
activate RagTab

RagTab -> ChatVM : 2. InitializeAsync()
activate ChatVM

ChatVM -> AISvc : 3. InitializeAsync(ct)
activate AISvc

AISvc -> Options : 4. RagOptions.LoadFromEnvironment()
activate Options
Options --> AISvc : 5. 配置参数\n(模型路径、端口、TopK等)
deactivate Options

AISvc -> FS : 6. 扫描文档目录
activate FS
FS --> AISvc : 7. 文档文件列表
deactivate FS

AISvc -> Embedder : 8. LoadFromFileAsync(embeddingModelPath)
activate Embedder
Embedder -> Embedder : 9. 加载 GGUF Embedding 模型\n(BGE-small, LLamaWeights)
Embedder --> AISvc : 10. LLamaEmbedder 就绪
deactivate Embedder

AISvc -> AISvc : 11. LoadCorpusAsync()\n对每个文档执行分块+向量化

loop 对每个文档
    AISvc -> AISvc : 12. MarkdownChunking/JsonChunking\n(标题分段/结构化分块)
    AISvc -> Embedder : 13. 计算文本块向量
    Embedder --> AISvc : 14. float[] 向量
end

AISvc -> AISvc : 15. 构建 EmbeddingCache\n(内存向量索引)

AISvc -> RerankerProc : 16. StartIfNeededAsync(\nrerankerModelPath, port, ct)
activate RerankerProc
RerankerProc -> RerankerProc : 17. 启动 llama-server\n--embedding --pooling rank\n--reranking
RerankerProc --> AISvc : 18. Reranker 服务就绪
deactivate RerankerProc

AISvc --> ChatVM : 19. 初始化完成
deactivate AISvc

ChatVM -> RagTab : 20. StatusText = "就绪"
deactivate ChatVM
RagTab --> User : 21. 显示"AI助手已就绪"
deactivate RagTab

== 阶段1：用户提交问题 ==

User -> RagTab : 22. 输入问题\n"这篇论文的实验方法是什么？"
activate RagTab

RagTab -> ChatVM : 23. SendAsync()
activate ChatVM

ChatVM -> ChatVM : 24. IsBusy = true\n记录用户消息到ConversationText

ChatVM -> AISvc : 25. AskAsync(question,\nhistory, ct)
activate AISvc

== 阶段2：查询理解 ==

AISvc -> QuerySvc : 26. BuildProfile(question)
activate QuerySvc
QuerySvc -> QuerySvc : 27. LocalAiQuestionAnalyzer.BuildProfile()\n正则匹配意图(explain/compare/...)\n提取焦点术语\n检测追问/新问题
QuerySvc -> Profile : 28. 构建 QueryProfile\n{Intent, FocusTerms, IsFollowUp}
activate Profile
Profile --> QuerySvc : 29. QueryProfile
deactivate Profile
QuerySvc --> AISvc : 30. QueryProfile
deactivate QuerySvc

== 阶段3：检索相关文档分块 ==

AISvc -> Embedder : 31. 计算问题向量
activate Embedder
Embedder --> AISvc : 32. queryEmbedding: float[]
deactivate Embedder

AISvc -> AISvc : 33. FindRelevantChunksAsync()\n计算余弦相似度\n(内存 EmbeddingCache)

loop 对每个缓存向量
    AISvc -> AISvc : 34. cosineSimilarity =\ndot(A,B) / (norm(A)*norm(B))
end

AISvc -> AISvc : 35. 取 Top-K 候选分块

AISvc -> Retriever : 36. TryRerankWithLearnedModelAsync(\nquery, candidates, ct)
activate Retriever
Retriever -> LlamaServer : 37. HTTP POST /rerank\n{query, documents}
activate LlamaServer
LlamaServer --> Retriever : 38. RerankScore[]\n(重排序分数)
deactivate LlamaServer
Retriever --> AISvc : 39. LearnedRerankResult\n(优化后的排序)
deactivate Retriever

AISvc -> Ranker : 40. ComputeTopChunkIntentBoost(\nchunk, profile)
activate Ranker
Ranker -> Ranker : 41. 根据查询意图计算加权\n(procedure/compare/definition\n各自不同的质量提升策略)
Ranker --> AISvc : 42. boostedScore
deactivate Ranker

AISvc -> Scored : 43. 构建 ScoredChunk 列表\n(最终排序结果)
activate Scored
Scored --> AISvc : 44. 排序后的候选分块
deactivate Scored

== 阶段4：组装Prompt并推理 ==

AISvc -> Composer : 45. BuildPrompt(question,\nscoredChunks, history)
activate Composer
Composer -> Composer : 46. 组装 System Prompt:\n角色定义 + 参考内容 + 问题\n+ 对话历史
Composer --> AISvc : 47. 完整 Prompt
deactivate Composer

AISvc -> ChatClient : 48. CompleteAsync(prompt, ct)
activate ChatClient

ChatClient -> LlamaServer : 49. HTTP POST /v1/chat/completions\n{model, messages, stream}
activate LlamaServer

loop 流式生成每个 Token
    LlamaServer --> ChatClient : 50. SSE data: {"choices":[{"delta":{"content":"token"}}]}
    ChatClient --> AISvc : 51. token string
    AISvc --> ChatVM : 52. 追加到 ConversationText
    ChatVM --> RagTab : 53. 更新界面显示
    RagTab --> User : 54. 实时显示回答
end

alt 响应被截断(长度限制)
    LlamaServer --> ChatClient : 55a. finish_reason: "length"
    ChatClient -> ChatClient : 55b. 自动发送续写请求\n传入已生成内容作为前缀
    ChatClient -> LlamaServer : 55c. POST /v1/chat/completions\n(continuation)
end

LlamaServer --> ChatClient : 56. 推理完成
deactivate LlamaServer

ChatClient --> AISvc : 57. 完整回答文本
deactivate ChatClient

== 阶段5：后处理与展示 ==

AISvc -> AISvc : 58. AnswerPostProcessing\n引用归一化\n离题检测\n修复提示(如有必要)

AISvc --> ChatVM : 59. 最终回答文本\n+ LastRetrievalDebug
deactivate AISvc

ChatVM -> ChatVM : 60. IsBusy = false
ChatVM --> RagTab : 61. ConversationText 已更新
deactivate ChatVM

RagTab --> User : 62. 显示完整回答
deactivate RagTab

note right of User
  <b>离线保障：</b>
  · Embedding → 本地 LLamaSharp
  · 检索 → 内存 EmbeddingCache
  · LLM → 本地 llama-server
  · Reranker → 本地 llama-server
  · 无外部网络请求。
end note

@enduml
